      "answer": "Rust src/main.rs snapshot() (line 129) resolves rev to an immutable commit with git rev-parse --verify, lists tracked objects with git ls-tree -r -z, and reads each included blob with git cat-file. Gitlinks/submodules are excluded as submodule_unavailable (lines 180-185); Git LFS pointer text is preserved with pointer_only status (205-208).",
