      "source_commit": "95963a23e2fd1e5eb68a72db3bde849ed7119a7c",
      "correct": true,
      "connector_calls": 0,
      "answer": "The GitHub Actions ZIP bootstrap is a trust boundary: member names, types, compression ratios and content hashes must pass checks before a single RGP is emitted. Blind extractall() bypasses these checks and introduces path traversal/write risks. The security model forbids trusting co-packed metadata as independent authenticity proof.",
      "evidence_url": "https://github.com/iivkis/rgp/blob/95963a23e2fd1e5eb68a72db3bde849ed7119a7c/python/rgp_bootstrap.py",
